              "text": "{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"stdout\\\": \\\"Found 5 alpha points: [('a000', 'seeds=[42]'), ('a025', 'seeds=[42]'), ('a050', 'seeds=[42]'), ('a075', 'seeds=[42]'), ('a100', 'seeds=[42, 43, 44, 45]')]\\\\n  a000 (a=0.0): 11 generations, seeds=[42]\\\\n  a025 (a=0.25): 11 generations, seeds=[42]\\\\n  a050 (a=0.5): 11 generations, seeds=[42]\\\\n  a075 (a=0.75): 11 generations, seeds=[42]\\\\n  a100 (a=1.0): 11 generations, seeds=[42, 43, 44, 45]\\\\n\\\\nRunning bidirectional Granger (8 pairs x 5 alphas, n_perms=5000)...\\\\n\\\\nRunning per-alpha consensus classification (5 methods x 16 pairs x 5 alphas)...\\\\n\\\\n================================================================================\\\\nCROSS-ALPHA ANALYSIS SUMMARY (v4)\\\\n================================================================================\\\\n\\\\nDOSE-RESPONSE (drift %)\\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\nMetric           | a=0.0   | a=0.25  | a=0.5   | a=0.75  | a=1.0  \\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\ndistinct_1       |   -13.8% |   -40.3% |   -37.3% |   -32.7% |   -28.3%\\\\ndistinct_2       |    -9.8% |   -57.1% |   -51.5% |   -41.3% |   -35.2%\\\\ndistinct_3       |    -4.5% |   -59.9% |   -52.4% |   -38.4% |   -31.6%\\\\ntoken_entropy    |    -5.1% |    -4.1% |   -18.6% |   -27.7% |   -60.5%\\\\nece              |   +51.7% |   +79.7% |  +842.8% | +1809.5% | +3762.6%\\\\nperplexity       |   -21.7% |   -17.2% |   +21.1% |  +182.1% | +3624.6%\\\\n\\\\nGRANGER CAUSALITY (bidirectional, differenced, permutation)\\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\nDirection            | a=0.0  p_raw   p_fdr | a=0.25 p_raw   p_fdr | a=0.5  p_raw   p_fdr | a=0.75 p_raw   p_fdr | a=1.0  p_raw   p_fdr\\\\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\\\\nentropy-